## 🧪 AI QA 시나리오 — <code>a1b2c3d</code> · ⚠️ PRD 정합성: **부분 일치**

> 연결된 문서: [PROJ-123](https://acme.atlassian.net/browse/PROJ-123) (Jira), [acme/shop#45](https://github.com/acme/shop/issues/45) (GitHub)

Adds coupon application to checkout.

### PRD 정합성

| 요구사항 | 상태 | 근거 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| AC1: a coupon can be applied once | ✅ 충족 | CouponService.apply() checks usage <code>src/coupon.ts</code> |
| AC3: expired coupons are rejected | ❌ 누락 | No expiry comparison in coupon.ts <code>src/coupon.ts</code> |

### 시나리오 (3)

<details><summary><b>[P0][엣지] S-01 · Apply a coupon one second before expiry</b></summary>

- **Given** a coupon that expires in 1 second
- **When** the user applies it at checkout
- **Then** the discount is applied
- _관련_: AC3: expired coupons are rejected · <code>src/coupon.ts</code>
- _이유_: Boundary of the expiry rule. · _신뢰도_: 높음

</details>

<details><summary><b>[P1][예외] S-02 · Apply the same coupon twice in parallel</b></summary>

- **Given** a coupon that was never used
- **And** two checkout tabs for the same cart
- **When** both tabs apply the coupon at the same moment
- **Then** exactly one request succeeds
- **And** the other one gets a <code>COUPON&#95;ALREADY&#95;USED</code> error
- _관련_: AC1: a coupon can be applied once · <code>src/coupon.ts</code>
- _이유_: Boundary of the expiry rule. · _신뢰도_: 보통

</details>

<details><summary><b>[P2][회귀] S-03 · Checkout without a coupon still works</b></summary>

- **Given** a cart without a coupon
- **When** the user pays
- **Then** the total is unchanged
- _신뢰도_: 낮음

</details>

### 리스크

- 🔴 **Missing expiry check** — AC3 not implemented <code>src/coupon.ts</code>
- 🟡 **No audit log** — Coupon use is not logged.

### 가정

- Coupon codes are case-insensitive.

